# Hand-maintained. NOT generated by roxygen2.
#
# The previous header claimed to be generated and told you to run
# devtools::document(). It was a lookalike: roxygen2's marker is the exact
# string "# Generated by roxygen2: do not edit by hand", and seeing anything
# else it refuses to touch the file — quietly, with "Skipping NAMESPACE". So
# every atom added after that header was written silently failed to be
# exported. `style()` and `*.gog_atom` were both missing, which meant
# `bar * bin` would not dispatch for anyone who installed the package.
#
# Nothing caught it because the tests and the book both source() R/*.R
# directly, which bypasses NAMESPACE entirely.
#
# When you add an atom, add it here. `exports_match_namespace` in
# tests/test_basic.R compares this file against the @export tags and fails if
# they drift.
